# hakios-mali on the phone (userland/src/mali, system27/userland/mali27.sh): mali-probe's stages against the kernel's
# HakiosMali, the first time as early as the service is there (it waits up to 60 s for it), before the window server
# has drawn much, then once more with every descriptor printed, once the home screen's GPU work runs beside it. Its
# verdicts go to the console and, as "!!mali-probe:" lines, into what the kernel keeps for the host. For the 27
# release's small image: MALI27=$OBJ/mali RC_JOBS=userland/rc.jobs.maliprobe (system27/mtk27.sh root), boot-arg mali=1.
/hakios/bin/mali-probe
/hakios/bin/rwtouch wait 90
/hakios/bin/mali-probe --dump
/hakios/bin/rwtouch wait 300
